A '''Plhlegblast''' is a {{Mythic}} [[Sea Creature]] that can be fished up from lava in the {{Zone|Plhlegblast Pool}}. 

== Spawning ==
A '''Plhlegblast''' has a {{Chance|0.1%|1|1,000|sea creatures}} base chance to override other [[Sea Creature]] spawns while fishing in the {{Zone|Plhlegblast Pool}} with {{skl|Fishing|36}} or higher. Certain modifiers can be used to increase its chance:

