== Behavior ==
The '''Plhlegblast''' does not attack the player, and is passive, similarly to the [[Squid]] and [[Inkling]]. It takes Lava damage, making it easy to kill. It has {{Stat|hp|500M}}.

== Usage ==
Bringing a '''Plhlegblast''' to {{NPCSprite|Kuudra Believer}} grants the player an option to obtain {{Item|Herring the Fish}} and {{Item|Kuudra Follower Helmet}} under specific conditions. 

