== Tips ==
Because a '''Plhlegblast''' can suffocate in the air easily, it is recommended to splash a {{PotN|Water Breathing 6}} potion to make it immune to suffocation if used for the purpose of the Kuudra Follower quest.

== Trivia ==
*The '''Plhlegblast''' has the highest {{stat|hp}} of any [[Sea Creature]] in SkyBlock.
*While the '''Plhlegblast''' is fished from lava, it does not count toward the {{Reforge|Chomp}} [[Reforging|Reforge]] bonus.

